      "content": "SP 8607          WENDOVER               AYLESBURY ROAD                                         west side 10/210                                  No.19 (formerly listed as                                         premises occupied by F. Wood  25/10/51 GV                                      II House; now Travel Agents. C18 red brick. Old tile roof with chimney at LH end, painted brick dentil cornice 2-storeys, plinth, 2 bays of 3-light transomed modern casement windows with cambered brick arches to ground floor; central 6-fielded panel door in delicately proportioned doorcase of narrow pilasters, reeded brackets and moulded dentil cornice, 3 stone steps. Listing NGR: SP8690307977"
